{"title":"2010 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The minute hand on a clock points at the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The minute hand then rotates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/4/9b49fcb2f74ccae5ec0e722a8c65b5b9bbd93720.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" /> clockwise. Which number will it be pointing at?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/7/ef78096414c474c2e37f7cfac0cbe73e1dc68064.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 6 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 2 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 3 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A full revolution would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96bd59024f5cb49b070ca9b0f8906499940c75e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$360^{\\circ}$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/4/9b49fcb2f74ccae5ec0e722a8c65b5b9bbd93720.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/d/e4d3b1d912e7c024310f4fc79df1730cfd43efd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{120^{\\circ}}{360^{\\circ}} = \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"39\" /> of the full revolution.\n</p><p>The clock is already pointing at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the numbers on a clock go from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so rotating the minute hand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/4/9b49fcb2f74ccae5ec0e722a8c65b5b9bbd93720.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" /> clockwise would make the clock point to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/a/c4aa33a1ca7fb6af6aa71fec5bc0ccfa3b125667.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3} \\times 12 = \\boxed{\\text{(C) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"130\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.